{"theory":{"blocks":[{"btype":"text","text":"الدرس 229. الكلمات الجديدة: gelacht، Affe، Februar، überlebt، Lastwagen، Schultern، Spitze، abgeben، Mütze، Dokumente، jenen."},{"btype":"example","text":"gelacht = ضَحْكَة","note":"صيغة من lachen (اسم المفعول (التصريف الثالث))؛ مثال: Er hat nicht gelacht. — لم يضحك."},{"btype":"example","text":"Affe = سَعْدَان","note":"مثال: Der Affe fiel vom Baum. — سقط القرد من الشجرة."},{"btype":"example","text":"Februar = فِبْرَايِر","note":""},{"btype":"example","text":"überlebt = يَنْجُو","note":"صيغة من überleben (اسم المفعول (التصريف الثالث))؛ مثال: Ich weiß, wie man überlebt. — انا اعرف كيفية النجاة"},{"btype":"example","text":"Lastwagen = شَاحِنَة","note":""},{"btype":"example","text":"Schultern = كَتِف","note":"صيغة من Schulter (الجمع)"},{"btype":"example","text":"Spitze = رَأْس","note":""},{"btype":"example","text":"abgeben = أَعْطَى","note":""},{"btype":"example","text":"Mütze = قُبَّعَة","note":"مثال: Was kostet diese Mütze? — ما ثمن هذه القبّعة؟"},{"btype":"example","text":"Dokumente = وَرَقَة","note":"صيغة من Dokument (الجمع، حالة الإضافة، حالة المفعول به)"},{"btype":"example","text":"jenen = ذَاكَ","note":"صيغة من jener (المذكّر، حالة المفعول به)؛ مثال: Warum hat sie jenen Hut gekauft? — لماذا اشترت تلك القبعة؟"},{"btype":"text","text":"جمل الدرس:"},{"btype":"example","text":"Er hat nicht gelacht.","note":"لم يضحك."},{"btype":"example","text":"Der Affe fiel vom Baum.","note":"سقط القرد من الشجرة."},{"btype":"example","text":"Was kostet diese Mütze?","note":"ما ثمن هذه القبّعة؟"},{"btype":"example","text":"Gehört diese Mütze dir?","note":"هل هذه القبعة لك؟"},{"btype":"example","text":"Ich weiß, wie man überlebt.","note":"انا اعرف كيفية النجاة"},{"btype":"example","text":"Warum hat sie jenen Hut gekauft?","note":"لماذا اشترت تلك القبعة؟"},{"btype":"example","text":"Jenen Tag werde ich nicht vergessen.","note":"لن أنس ذلك اليوم أبدا."},{"btype":"example","text":"\"Warum ist der Affe aus dem Baum gefallen?\" \"Das weiß ich nicht, Tom. Warum?\" \"Weil er tot war.\"","note":"\"لماذا سقط القرد من الشجرة؟\" \"لا أعرف يا توم. لماذا؟\" \"لأنه كان ميتا.\""},{"btype":"example","text":"Es ist auch mein Geld.","note":"هذا مالي أيضا."},{"btype":"example","text":"Ich weiß, wer ich bin.","note":"أعرف من أكون."}]},"practice":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"lang.translate","count":4,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":5,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.cloze","count":4,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.build","count":3,"data":"@bundle"}]},"quiz":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.translate","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.reverse","count":2,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.cloze","count":2,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.write","count":2,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"lang.listen","count":2,"data":"@bundle"}]},"review":{"blocks":[{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.dictation","count":3,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"phr.build","count":2,"data":"@bundle"},{"btype":"generated","generator":"lang.truefalse","count":2,"data":"@bundle"}]},"data":{"lang":"de","lang_name":"الألمانية","sentences":[{"t":"Er hat nicht gelacht.","ar":"لم يضحك."},{"t":"Der Affe fiel vom Baum.","ar":"سقط القرد من الشجرة."},{"t":"Was kostet diese Mütze?","ar":"ما ثمن هذه القبّعة؟"},{"t":"Gehört diese Mütze dir?","ar":"هل هذه القبعة لك؟"},{"t":"Ich weiß, wie man überlebt.","ar":"انا اعرف كيفية النجاة"},{"t":"Warum hat sie jenen Hut gekauft?","ar":"لماذا اشترت تلك القبعة؟"},{"t":"Jenen Tag werde ich nicht vergessen.","ar":"لن أنس ذلك اليوم أبدا."},{"t":"\"Warum ist der Affe aus dem Baum gefallen?\" \"Das weiß ich nicht, Tom. Warum?\" \"Weil er tot war.\"","ar":"\"لماذا سقط القرد من الشجرة؟\" \"لا أعرف يا توم. لماذا؟\" \"لأنه كان ميتا.\""},{"t":"Es ist auch mein Geld.","ar":"هذا مالي أيضا."},{"t":"Ich weiß, wer ich bin.","ar":"أعرف من أكون."},{"t":"Sie weiß, wer du bist.","ar":"هي تعلم من أنت."},{"t":"Ich weiß, wer sie ist.","ar":"أعلم من هي."}],"focus":["gelacht","Affe","Februar","überlebt","Lastwagen","Schultern","Spitze","abgeben","Mütze","Dokumente","jenen"],"words":[{"word":"Affe","topic":"L229","difficulty":2,"meaning":"سَعْدَان","example":"Der Affe fiel vom Baum.","translation":"سقط القرد من الشجرة."},{"word":"Februar","topic":"L229","difficulty":2,"meaning":"فِبْرَايِر"},{"word":"Lastwagen","topic":"L229","difficulty":2,"meaning":"شَاحِنَة"},{"word":"Spitze","topic":"L229","difficulty":2,"meaning":"رَأْس"},{"word":"abgeben","topic":"L229","difficulty":2,"meaning":"أَعْطَى"},{"word":"Mütze","topic":"L229","difficulty":2,"meaning":"قُبَّعَة","example":"Was kostet diese Mütze?","translation":"ما ثمن هذه القبّعة؟"}],"difficulty":2}}